    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_03",
      "hash64": "01CFAF9AF1E7E7C4",
      "text": "Chuuu!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_11",
      "hash64": "F78405D5B9B78B0E",
      "text": "So klingt Pikachu, wenn es sich freut! Da tanzt\\nman doch schon fast selbst vor Freude, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_12",
      "hash64": "F78404D5B9B7895B",
      "text": "Heute hat Pikachu euch nichts vorgespielt.\\nSeine Freude war echt. Es hat ihm Spaß gemacht,\\r\\nmit euch an diesem Kurs teilzunehmen![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_13",
      "hash64": "F78403D5B9B787A8",
      "text": "Es hat euch kennengelernt und gemeinsam mit\\neuch Neues gelernt.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_14",
      "hash64": "F7840AD5B9B7938D",
      "text": "Sowohl für Pikachu als auch für mich war dieser\\nKurs die reinste Freude.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_15",
      "hash64": "F78409D5B9B791DA",
      "text": "Und an dieser Stelle ein letzter Tipp von mir an\\neuch![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_16",
      "hash64": "F78408D5B9B79027",
      "text": "In Zukunft werdet ihr sicher viele Dinge erleben,\\ndie euch wütend oder traurig machen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_17",
      "hash64": "F78407D5B9B78E74",
      "text": "Im Leben geht es auf und ab, genau wie auf einer\\nAchterbahn.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_18",
      "hash64": "F783FED5B9B77F29",
      "text": "Doch am Ende wartet immer Freude auf euch,\\nalso geht auch durch schwere Zeiten mit einem\\r\\nLächeln auf den Lippen. Smile![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_04",
      "hash64": "01CFAE9AF1E7E611",
      "text": "Chuuu!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_19",
      "hash64": "F783FDD5B9B77D76",
      "text": "Wenn ihr euch in einer Situation befindet, die ihr\\nalleine nicht bewältigen könnt, dann vertraut\\r\\neuch jemandem an, egal ob Lehrern, Familie\\r\\noder Freunden.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_20",
      "hash64": "F7870CD5B9B9CCCA",
      "text": "Nächste Stunde findet die Abschlussprüfung statt.\\nSeht zu, dass ihr alles gut wiederholt, was wir hier\\r\\nbehandelt haben. Adiós und bye-bye![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
